# Force LF for all text files on checkout, on every machine.
#
# Shell scripts must stay LF to run on POSIX shells, and the ship/freeze manifests raw-hash
# working-tree bytes — a CRLF working tree (Windows git core.autocrlf=true) breaks both. Forcing
# LF keeps every checkout byte-identical to the LF-hashed manifest.
* text=auto eol=lf
